   "equipment": "stovetop",
   "hands_on_minutes": 2,
   "hands_off_minutes": 8
  },
  {
   "section": "stovetop",
   "text": "Add the chicken with its marinade and simmer, covered, until cooked through, 12 to 15 minutes. Stir in the cream, the remaining butter and garam masala.",
